    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POLY IMPULSE</strong> is a minimalist fast-paced movement FPS where you will have to shoot colorful polyhedrons to impulse yourself through the level. Accuracy is also very important so you will put your aim to a test with this game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Shoot neon green icosahedron to impulse yourself and gain speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/e7befb02cf1906ca8c14351092b8c473.poster.avif?t=1755098164\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/e7befb02cf1906ca8c14351092b8c473.webm?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/e7befb02cf1906ca8c14351092b8c473.mp4?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Speedrun the levels and compete with yourself and the global leaderboard to prove that you are the number one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/6ac04893349ba4a48cf4f0d93c8d025d.poster.avif?t=1755098164\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/6ac04893349ba4a48cf4f0d93c8d025d.webm?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/6ac04893349ba4a48cf4f0d93c8d025d.mp4?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Different polyhedrons have different effects, shoot them and master their effects to get better ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/03e16ddcdedc4a674f86f5da214d0d64.poster.avif?t=1755098164\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/03e16ddcdedc4a674f86f5da214d0d64.webm?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/03e16ddcdedc4a674f86f5da214d0d64.mp4?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Use the Replay System to download other player runs on the leaderboard and learn how they get the best times!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/63fd4e6fdbee13bcf4a11c1cda649378.poster.avif?t=1755098164\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/63fd4e6fdbee13bcf4a11c1cda649378.webm?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/63fd4e6fdbee13bcf4a11c1cda649378.mp4?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POLY IMPULSE</strong> is a minimalist fast-paced movement FPS where you will have to shoot colorful polyhedrons to impulse yourself through the level. Accuracy is also very important so you will put your aim to a test with this game! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Shoot neon green icosahedron to impulse yourself and gain speed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/e7befb02cf1906ca8c14351092b8c473.poster.avif?t=1755098164\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/e7befb02cf1906ca8c14351092b8c473.webm?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/e7befb02cf1906ca8c14351092b8c473.mp4?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Speedrun the levels and compete with yourself and the global leaderboard to prove that you are the number one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/6ac04893349ba4a48cf4f0d93c8d025d.poster.avif?t=1755098164\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/6ac04893349ba4a48cf4f0d93c8d025d.webm?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/6ac04893349ba4a48cf4f0d93c8d025d.mp4?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Different polyhedrons have different effects, shoot them and master their effects to get better ranks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/03e16ddcdedc4a674f86f5da214d0d64.poster.avif?t=1755098164\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/03e16ddcdedc4a674f86f5da214d0d64.webm?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/03e16ddcdedc4a674f86f5da214d0d64.mp4?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Use the Replay System to download other player runs on the leaderboard and learn how they get the best times!<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/63fd4e6fdbee13bcf4a11c1cda649378.poster.avif?t=1755098164\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/63fd4e6fdbee13bcf4a11c1cda649378.webm?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2805260/extras/63fd4e6fdbee13bcf4a11c1cda649378.mp4?t=1755098164\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
